{"id": "q0107", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 886590172, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "The binary number $10101001110_{2}$ is equal to what number in base eight?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0107.wav", "input_sha256": "277432346d46c23d4f439a20dae8ef9e389b5b8a4e12c678ef0c525cdbca2632", "input_samples": 140400, "input_s": 8.775, "n_real_chunks": 9, "score": 0.8569, "act": 0.9994, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "The binary number 11 01 102 is equal to the octal number 3 56.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 8, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 7, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0107_local_local.wav", "sha256": "6cf57a16a9c98e456f6aac233949cbc7075e0f21315effb8ab3d04acc449aada", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 7.2}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.058, 1.105, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.059, 2.107, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.059, 3.106, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.06, 4.109, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.06, 5.109, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.061, 6.11, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.06, 7.11, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.061, 8.11, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 8.775, 8.837, 9.471, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.775, 9.839, 10.399, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.775, 10.846, 11.509, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.775, 11.837, 12.383, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.775, 12.838, 13.428, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.775, 13.838, 14.408, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.775, 14.838, 15.367, 0, 28800, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 8.775, "last_real_feed_done": 8.837, "onset": 9.471, "gate_read_done": 9.471, "fire": null, "candidate_first_pcm": null, "stall_note": null, "stall_first_pcm": null, "local_first_pcm": 9.471, "wait_start": null, "expert_req": null, "expert_resp": null, "relay_synth_start": null, "relay_first_pcm": null, "relay_synth_end": null, "first_any_pcm": 9.471, "first_answer_pcm": 9.471, "session_end": 15.367}, "ttfa_answer_s": 0.696, "ttfa_any_s": 0.696}
{"id": "q0130", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2173799612, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Simplify $\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2+\\sqrt{3}}$. Your solution can be converted to the form $A(1+\\sqrt{B})-(\\sqrt{C}+\\sqrt{D})$, where $A$, $B$, $C$, and $D$ are positive integers. What is $A+B+C+D$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0130.wav", "input_sha256": "9481880189fdb3cb8e185387777b47db300a5abb72179d4d9d03169002856cf2", "input_samples": 222000, "input_s": 13.875, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.8258, "act": 0.9956, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So we have 1 over 1 plus the square root of 2. We want to rationalize the denominator, so we' re going to multiply the top and bottom by 1 minus the square root of 2. That's going to give us 1 minus the square root of 2 over 1 minus the square root of 2 times 1 plus the square root of 2. The denominator is a difference of squares, so that's just 1 minus 2, which is negative 1. And then our numerator is just 1 minus the square root of 2. If we divide by negative 1, that gives us the square root of 2 minus 1 over 1. So this is in the form A times 1 plus the square root of B, where A is negative 1, B is 2, C is 1, D is 1. So A plus B plus C plus D is negative 1 plus 2 plus 1 plus 1, which is 3.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 49, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files