{"id": "q0163", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1710172483, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "James Owen accepted a draft, dated December 9, drawn by Parker Bros, for $815.50 at 6% payable 4 months after date. Parker Bros, had the draft discounted at the bank on January 9 at 6(1/2)%. A charge of (1/8)% for collecting it when due was also charged. What were the proceeds?\n\nA. $809.35\nB. $817.2\nC. $13.52\nD. $792.40\nE. $834.67\nF. $842.10\nG. $815.50\nH. $800.00\nI. $825.75\nJ. $831.81\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0163.wav", "input_sha256": "ef4c674ce106605ce2bc1c890fa93caa4a73ee58d3d1189763a69bc5055d7725", "input_samples": 607400, "input_s": 37.962, "n_real_chunks": 38, "score": 0.9616, "act": 0.9986, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "The answer is A, $8 09. 35. First, calculate the discount interest for four months at 6. 5% on $8 50.50: $ 85 0.50 times 0.065 times 1/ 3 equals approximately $ 14. 7 2. Then subtract that from the face value to get $ 83 5.7 8. Next, account for the collection charge of 8% on the face value over four months: $ 850.5 0 times 0.0 0667 equals about $ 56. 70. Finally, sub tract this from the discounted amount: $8 3 5.78 minus $5 6.7 0 gives $ 8 09.3 5. So the proceeds were $8 09. 35.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 38, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 50, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio